# KONSOLIDIERUNG — L1 Kernel Consolidation Plan (16 -> 6)

Status: **draft for manager approval.** No repos created, no code moved, no
source touched. Prepared from live inventory of `/Projects/openOODA-kernel/`
plus `persona-ownership.oot` §2 and `northstar.oot` L1.

## 1. Northstar Target Map

Per `northstar.oot` L1 and `persona-ownership.oot` §2 — six canonical hosts,
each a rename of one source repo plus vendored absorbed siblings:

| Canonical (new) | Rename source | Absorbed siblings | Domain |
|---|---|---|---|
| `ooboot` | ookernel-boot | — | UEFI boot |
| `oohal` | ookernel-hal-x86 | ookernel-hal-arm64, ookernel-hal-riscv | x86_64/aarch64/riscv64 HAL |
| `ookernel` | ookernel-sched | ookernel-mm, ookernel-ipc, ookernel-ob, ookernel-iommu, ookernel-unikernel | NT Ob + seL4 CSpace microkernel |
| `oodrv-storage` | oodrv-nvme | — | Ring-3 storage driver |
| `oodrv-io` | oodrv-net | oodrv-usb-hid, oodrv-display-gop, oodrv-pci | Ring-3 I/O drivers |
| `oodrv-virt` | oodrv-virtio | — | Ring-3 virtio driver |

